# Workspace policy — never commit local-only project notes.
CLAUDE.md
STATE.md
SPEC.md
SPEC*.md
0[0-9]-*.md
adrs/

# Claude Code per-project settings + hook tree (local) — ANCHORED to the
# repo root only. setlint's test fixtures legitimately contain .claude/
# directories (it lints settings.json, which lives in .claude/); a bare
# `.claude/` would silently drop those fixtures from the repo.
/.claude/

# Local scratch / editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Local test sandboxes (used by ad-hoc smoke tests)
tmp/
*.tsv.local

# Logs
*.log
